        "ggY1Sxs7a2Z_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#2D2D2D;font-size:20px;\"><strong>How Prelaunch Works</strong></span></p>",
        "gg_6-QOXmj4_text": "<p>By leaving a small refundable deposit (typically 1–5% of the product’s price), you secure the right to purchase this product at a special pre-launch discount once it becomes available. Your reservation is fully protected by our refund guarantee until successful delivery.</p>",
        "gg_Y0R4genA_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#4D4D4D;font-size:15px;\">Your reservation deposit is safe with us. If you change your mind before the launch or don’t receive the product, you can claim a full refund.</span></p>",
